/* Nota Bab 1 ikut buku teks Matematik T3 KSSM. Dijana skrip; jangan sunting dengan tangan. */
window.SUBS=[{"no": "1.1", "name": "Tatatanda Indeks", "col": "#FBBF24"}, {"no": "1.2", "name": "Hukum Indeks", "col": "#A78BFA"}];
window.SLIDES=[{"sub": "1.1", "n": 1, "N": 5, "kicker": "DEFINISI", "title": "Bentuk indeks", "body": "<p class=\"sl-p\">Suatu nombor yang didarab secara berulang boleh ditulis dalam bentuk indeks.</p><div class=\"sl-def\" style=\"--c:#FBBF24\"><p>Nilai indeks dalam suatu bentuk indeks adalah sama dengan bilangan kali asas didarab secara berulang. Secara generalisasi, <i>a</i><sup><i>n</i></sup> = <i>a</i> × <i>a</i> × <i>a</i> × … × <i>a</i> (<i>n</i> faktor); <i>a</i> ≠ 0</p></div><div class=\"sl-note\"><b>Ingat:</b> <i>a</i> ialah asas dan <i>n</i> ialah indeks.</div>", "fig": "<div style=\"width:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:18px;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:30px\"><div style=\"font-size:72px;font-weight:800\"><i>a</i><sup style=\"color:#F472B6\"><i>n</i></sup></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:40px;font-size:20px\"><span><b style=\"color:#38BDF8\"><i>a</i></b> : asas</span><span><b style=\"color:#F472B6\"><i>n</i></b> : indeks</span></div><div style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700\">5<sup>4</sup> = 5 × 5 × 5 × 5</div><div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#B6C2D3\">dibaca \"5 kuasa 4\"</div></div>", "full": ""}, {"sub": "1.1", "n": 2, "N": 5, "kicker": "CONTOH 1", "title": "Menulis dalam bentuk indeks", "body": "<p class=\"sl-p\">Tulis pendaraban berulang berikut dalam bentuk indeks.</p><ul class=\"sl-bul\" style=\"--c:#FBBF24\"><li><span>(a) 6 × 6 × 6 × 6</span></li><li><span>(b) (−3) × (−3) × (−3) × (−3) × (−3)</span></li><li><span>(c) 0.2 × 0.2 × 0.2</span></li><li><span>(d) <span class=\"fr\"><span>2</span><span>5</span></span> × <span class=\"fr\"><span>2</span><span>5</span></span> × <span class=\"fr\"><span>2</span><span>5</span></span> × <span class=\"fr\"><span>2</span><span>5</span></span></span></li><li><span>(e) <i>p</i> × <i>p</i> × <i>p</i> × <i>p</i> × <i>p</i> × <i>p</i></span></li><li><span>(f) <i>k</i> × <i>k</i> × … × <i>k</i> (berulang <i>n</i> kali)</span></li></ul>", "fig": "<div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5\"><div><div class=\"rv\">(a) 6<sup>4</sup> &nbsp; (berulang empat kali)</div><div class=\"rv\">(b) (−3)<sup>5</sup> &nbsp; (berulang lima kali)</div><div class=\"rv\">(c) (0.2)<sup>3</sup> &nbsp; (berulang tiga kali)</div><div class=\"rv\">(d) (<span class=\"fr\"><span>2</span><span>5</span></span>)<sup>4</sup> &nbsp; (berulang empat kali)</div><div class=\"rv\">(e) <i>p</i><sup>6</sup> &nbsp; (berulang enam kali)</div><div class=\"rv\">(f) <i>k</i><sup><i>n</i></sup></div></div></div>", "full": ""}, {"sub": "1.1", "n": 3, "N": 5, "kicker": "CONTOH 2", "title": "Menukar nombor kepada bentuk indeks", "body": "<p class=\"sl-p\">Suatu nombor boleh ditulis dalam bentuk indeks jika suatu asas yang sesuai dipilih. Anda boleh menggunakan kaedah pembahagian berulang atau kaedah pendaraban berulang untuk menukar suatu nombor kepada nombor dalam bentuk indeks.</p><p class=\"sl-p\"><b>CONTOH 2</b> Tuliskan 81 dalam bentuk indeks dengan menggunakan asas 3 dan asas 9.</p><div class=\"sl-note\"><b>Tip:</b> Pembahagian diteruskan sehingga mendapat nilai 1.</div>", "fig": "<div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5\"><div><b style=\"color:#FBBF24\">Kaedah pembahagian berulang (asas 3)</b> <div class=\"rv\">81 ÷ 3 = 27, 27 ÷ 3 = 9, 9 ÷ 3 = 3, 3 ÷ 3 = 1</div><div class=\"rv\">81 dibahagi secara berulang dengan 3 sebanyak 4 kali.</div><div class=\"rv\">Maka, 81 = 3<sup>4</sup></div></div><div><b style=\"color:#FBBF24\">Kaedah pendaraban berulang (asas 3)</b> <div class=\"rv\">3 × 3 = 9, 9 × 3 = 27, 27 × 3 = 81</div><div class=\"rv\">Maka, 81 = 3<sup>4</sup></div></div><div><b style=\"color:#FBBF24\">Asas 9</b> <div class=\"rv\">81 ÷ 9 = 9, 9 ÷ 9 = 1  atau  9 × 9 = 81</div><div class=\"rv\">Maka, 81 = 9<sup>2</sup></div></div></div>", "full": ""}, {"sub": "1.1", "n": 4, "N": 5, "kicker": "CONTOH 3", "title": "Pecahan dalam bentuk indeks", "body": "<p class=\"sl-p\">Tuliskan <span class=\"fr\"><span>27</span><span>125</span></span> dalam bentuk indeks dengan menggunakan asas <span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>5</span></span>.</p><div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px 18px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5\"><div><b style=\"color:#FBBF24\">Kaedah pembahagian berulang</b> <div class=\"rv\">27 ÷ 3 = 9, 9 ÷ 3 = 3, 3 ÷ 3 = 1 (3 kali)</div><div class=\"rv\">125 ÷ 5 = 25, 25 ÷ 5 = 5, 5 ÷ 5 = 1 (3 kali)</div><div class=\"rv\">Maka, <span class=\"fr\"><span>27</span><span>125</span></span> = (<span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>5</span></span>)<sup>3</sup></div></div><div><b style=\"color:#FBBF24\">Kaedah pendaraban berulang</b> <div class=\"rv\"><span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>5</span></span> × <span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>5</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span>9</span><span>25</span></span></div><div class=\"rv\"><span class=\"fr\"><span>9</span><span>25</span></span> × <span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>5</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span>27</span><span>125</span></span></div><div class=\"rv\">Maka, <span class=\"fr\"><span>27</span><span>125</span></span> = (<span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>5</span></span>)<sup>3</sup></div></div></div><div class=\"sl-note\"><b>Ingat:</b> Bagi pecahan, pengangka dan penyebut dibahagi atau didarab secara berulang dengan bilangan kali yang sama.</div>", "fig": "", "full": ""}, {"sub": "1.1", "n": 5, "N": 5, "kicker": "CONTOH 4", "title": "Nilai nombor dalam bentuk indeks", "body": "<p class=\"sl-p\">Nilai <i>a</i><sup><i>n</i></sup> boleh ditentukan dengan kaedah pendaraban berulang atau dengan menggunakan kalkulator saintifik.</p><p class=\"sl-p\"><b>CONTOH 4</b> Hitung nilai bagi nombor dalam bentuk indeks yang diberi. (a) 3<sup>4</sup> (b) (0.4)<sup>3</sup></p><div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px 18px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5\"><div><b style=\"color:#FBBF24\">(a)</b> <div class=\"rv\">3<sup>4</sup> = 3 × 3 × 3 × 3</div><div class=\"rv\">= 9 × 9</div><div class=\"rv\">Maka, 3<sup>4</sup> = 81</div></div><div><b style=\"color:#FBBF24\">(b)</b> <div class=\"rv\">(0.4)<sup>3</sup> = 0.4 × 0.4 × 0.4</div><div class=\"rv\">= 0.16 × 0.4</div><div class=\"rv\">Maka, (0.4)<sup>3</sup> = 0.064</div></div></div><div class=\"sl-note\"><b>Peringatan:</b> Asas bernilai negatif dan pecahan ditulis bersama tanda kurung semasa menggunakan kalkulator untuk menentukan nilai nombor tersebut.</div>", "fig": "<div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5\"><div><b style=\"color:#FBBF24\">CONTOH 5</b> <div class=\"rv\">Hitung nilai bagi nombor dalam bentuk indeks dengan menggunakan kalkulator.</div></div><div><div class=\"rv\">(a) 4<sup>5</sup> = 1 024</div><div class=\"rv\">(b) (−2)<sup>7</sup> = −128</div><div class=\"rv\">(c) (<span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>4</span></span>)<sup>3</sup> = <span class=\"fr\"><span>27</span><span>64</span></span></div><div class=\"rv\">(d) (1<span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span>)<sup>4</sup> = <span class=\"fr\"><span>81</span><span>16</span></span></div><div class=\"rv\">(e) (−0.3)<sup>4</sup> = 0.0081</div></div></div>", "full": ""}, {"sub": "1.2", "n": 1, "N": 17, "kicker": "HUKUM", "title": "Pendaraban nombor dalam bentuk indeks", "body": "<p class=\"sl-p\">Apakah kaitan antara pendaraban nombor dalam bentuk indeks yang mempunyai asas yang sama dengan pendaraban berulang?</p><p class=\"sl-p\">Secara generalisasi,</p><div style=\"display:inline-block;margin:6px 0;padding:10px 18px;border:2px solid #A78BFA;border-radius:14px;background:#131C2E;font-size:21px;font-weight:700\"><i>a</i><sup><i>m</i></sup> × <i>a</i><sup><i>n</i></sup> = <i>a</i><sup><i>m</i> + <i>n</i></sup></div><div class=\"sl-note\"><b>Tip:</b> Kumpulkan nombor atau sebutan algebra dengan asas yang sama terlebih dahulu. Kemudian, tambahkan indeks bagi asas yang sama.</div>", "fig": "<div class=\"sl-table\" style=\"width:100%\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#131C2E\"><thead><tr><th style=\"padding:7px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:16px;color:#A78BFA;border:1px solid #22304A;background:#0E1626\">Pendaraban nombor dalam bentuk indeks</th><th style=\"padding:7px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:16px;color:#A78BFA;border:1px solid #22304A;background:#0E1626\">Pendaraban berulang</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\">2<sup>3</sup> × 2<sup>4</sup></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\">(2 × 2 × 2) × (2 × 2 × 2 × 2) = 2<sup>7</sup> = 2<sup>3 + 4</sup></td></tr><tr class=\"rv\"><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\">3<sup>2</sup> × 3<sup>3</sup></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\">(3 × 3) × (3 × 3 × 3) = 3<sup>5</sup> = 3<sup>2 + 3</sup></td></tr><tr class=\"rv\"><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\">5<sup>4</sup> × 5<sup>2</sup></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\">(5 × 5 × 5 × 5) × (5 × 5) = 5<sup>6</sup> = 5<sup>4 + 2</sup></td></tr></tbody></table></div>", "full": ""}, {"sub": "1.2", "n": 2, "N": 17, "kicker": "CONTOH 6", "title": "Hukum pendaraban", "body": "<p class=\"sl-p\">Ringkaskan setiap yang berikut. (a) 5<sup>3</sup> × 5<sup>4</sup> (b) (0.3)<sup>2</sup> × (0.3)<sup>5</sup> × (0.3) (c) 3<i>k</i><sup>2</sup> × 4<i>k</i><sup>3</sup> (d) 2<i>m</i><sup>4</sup> × <span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>4</span></span><i>m</i><sup>2</sup> × 6<i>m</i></p><div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px 18px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5\"><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">(a)</b> <div class=\"rv\">5<sup>3</sup> × 5<sup>4</sup> = 5<sup>3 + 4</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">= 5<sup>7</sup></div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">(b)</b> <div class=\"rv\">(0.3)<sup>2</sup> × (0.3)<sup>5</sup> × (0.3)<sup>1</sup> = (0.3)<sup>2 + 5 + 1</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">= (0.3)<sup>8</sup></div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">(c)</b> <div class=\"rv\">3<i>k</i><sup>2</sup> × 4<i>k</i><sup>3</sup> = (3 × 4)<i>k</i><sup>2 + 3</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">= 12<i>k</i><sup>5</sup></div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">(d)</b> <div class=\"rv\">(2 × <span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>4</span></span> × 6)<i>m</i><sup>4 + 2 + 1</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">= 3<i>m</i><sup>7</sup></div></div></div><div class=\"sl-note\"><b>Peringatan:</b> <i>a</i> = <i>a</i><sup>1</sup></div>", "fig": "<div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5\"><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">CONTOH 7</b> <div class=\"rv\">Ringkaskan setiap yang berikut. (a) <i>m</i><sup>3</sup> × <i>n</i><sup>2</sup> × <i>m</i><sup>4</sup> × <i>n</i> (b) (0.2)<sup>3</sup> × (0.5)<sup>2</sup> × (0.2) × (0.5)<sup>4</sup></div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">(a)</b> <div class=\"rv\">= <i>m</i><sup>3</sup> × <i>m</i><sup>4</sup> × <i>n</i><sup>2</sup> × <i>n</i><sup>1</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">= <i>m</i><sup>3 + 4</sup> × <i>n</i><sup>2 + 1</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">= <i>m</i><sup>7</sup><i>n</i><sup>3</sup></div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">(b)</b> <div class=\"rv\">= (0.2)<sup>3</sup> × (0.2)<sup>1</sup> × (0.5)<sup>2</sup> × (0.5)<sup>4</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">= (0.2)<sup>3 + 1</sup> × (0.5)<sup>2 + 4</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">= (0.2)<sup>4</sup> × (0.5)<sup>6</sup></div></div></div>", "full": ""}, {"sub": "1.2", "n": 3, "N": 17, "kicker": "HUKUM", "title": "Pembahagian nombor dalam bentuk indeks", "body": "<p class=\"sl-p\">Apakah kaitan antara pembahagian nombor dalam bentuk indeks yang mempunyai asas yang sama dengan pendaraban berulang?</p><div class=\"sl-table\" style=\"width:100%\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#131C2E\"><thead><tr><th style=\"padding:7px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:15px;color:#A78BFA;border:1px solid #22304A;background:#0E1626\">Pembahagian</th><th style=\"padding:7px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:15px;color:#A78BFA;border:1px solid #22304A;background:#0E1626\">Pendaraban berulang</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\">4<sup>5</sup> ÷ 4<sup>2</sup></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\"><span class=\"fr\"><span>4 × 4 × 4 × 4 × 4</span><span>4 × 4</span></span> = 4<sup>3</sup> = 4<sup>5 − 2</sup></td></tr><tr class=\"rv\"><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\">2<sup>6</sup> ÷ 2<sup>2</sup></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\"><span class=\"fr\"><span>2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2</span><span>2 × 2</span></span> = 2<sup>4</sup> = 2<sup>6 − 2</sup></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"sl-p\">Secara generalisasi,</p><div style=\"display:inline-block;margin:6px 0;padding:10px 18px;border:2px solid #A78BFA;border-radius:14px;background:#131C2E;font-size:21px;font-weight:700\"><i>a</i><sup><i>m</i></sup> ÷ <i>a</i><sup><i>n</i></sup> = <i>a</i><sup><i>m</i> − <i>n</i></sup></div>", "fig": "<div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5\"><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">CONTOH 8</b> <div class=\"rv\">Ringkaskan setiap yang berikut. (a) 6<sup>7</sup> ÷ 6<sup>3</sup> (b) (−2)<sup>8</sup> ÷ (−2)<sup>5</sup> (c) <i>p</i><sup>9</sup> ÷ <i>p</i><sup>4</sup> (d) 20<i>x</i><sup>6</sup><i>y</i><sup>5</sup> ÷ 4<i>x</i><sup>2</sup><i>y</i><sup>3</sup></div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">(a)</b> <div class=\"rv\">= 6<sup>7 − 3</sup> = 6<sup>4</sup></div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">(b)</b> <div class=\"rv\">= (−2)<sup>8 − 5</sup> = (−2)<sup>3</sup> = −8</div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">(c)</b> <div class=\"rv\">= <i>p</i><sup>9 − 4</sup> = <i>p</i><sup>5</sup></div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">(d)</b> <div class=\"rv\">= <span class=\"fr\"><span>20</span><span>4</span></span> × <i>x</i><sup>6 − 2</sup> × <i>y</i><sup>5 − 3</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">= 5<i>x</i><sup>4</sup><i>y</i><sup>2</sup></div></div></div>", "full": ""}, {"sub": "1.2", "n": 4, "N": 17, "kicker": "HUKUM", "title": "Nombor dalam bentuk indeks yang dikuasakan", "body": "<div class=\"sl-table\" style=\"width:100%\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#131C2E\"><thead><tr><th style=\"padding:7px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:15px;color:#A78BFA;border:1px solid #22304A;background:#0E1626\">Bentuk indeks yang dikuasakan</th><th style=\"padding:7px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:15px;color:#A78BFA;border:1px solid #22304A;background:#0E1626\">Pendaraban berulang</th><th style=\"padding:7px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:15px;color:#A78BFA;border:1px solid #22304A;background:#0E1626\">Kesimpulan</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\">(3<sup>2</sup>)<sup>4</sup></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\">3<sup>2</sup> × 3<sup>2</sup> × 3<sup>2</sup> × 3<sup>2</sup> = 3<sup>2 + 2 + 2 + 2</sup> = 3<sup>8</sup></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\">(3<sup>2</sup>)<sup>4</sup> = 3<sup>2(4)</sup></td></tr><tr class=\"rv\"><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\">(5<sup>4</sup>)<sup>3</sup></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\">5<sup>4</sup> × 5<sup>4</sup> × 5<sup>4</sup> = 5<sup>4 + 4 + 4</sup> = 5<sup>12</sup></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\">(5<sup>4</sup>)<sup>3</sup> = 5<sup>4(3)</sup></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"sl-p\">Secara generalisasi,</p><div style=\"display:inline-block;margin:6px 0;padding:10px 18px;border:2px solid #A78BFA;border-radius:14px;background:#131C2E;font-size:21px;font-weight:700\">(<i>a</i><sup><i>m</i></sup>)<sup><i>n</i></sup> = <i>a</i><sup><i>mn</i></sup></div><div style=\"display:inline-block;margin:6px 0;padding:10px 18px;border:2px solid #A78BFA;border-radius:14px;background:#131C2E;font-size:21px;font-weight:700\">(<i>a</i><sup><i>m</i></sup><i>b</i><sup><i>n</i></sup>)<sup><i>p</i></sup> = <i>a</i><sup><i>mp</i></sup><i>b</i><sup><i>np</i></sup> &nbsp; ; &nbsp; (<span class=\"fr\"><span><i>a</i><sup><i>m</i></sup></span><span><i>b</i><sup><i>n</i></sup></span></span>)<sup><i>p</i></sup> = <span class=\"fr\"><span><i>a</i><sup><i>mp</i></sup></span><span><i>b</i><sup><i>np</i></sup></span></span></div>", "fig": "<div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5\"><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">CONTOH 9</b> <div class=\"rv\">1. Permudahkan: (a) (3<sup>4</sup>)<sup>2</sup> (b) (<i>k</i><sup>5</sup>)<sup>3</sup> (c) ((−<i>y</i>)<sup>2</sup>)<sup>4</sup></div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">Penyelesaian:</b> <div class=\"rv\">(a) 3<sup>4(2)</sup> = 3<sup>8</sup> &nbsp; (b) <i>k</i><sup>5(3)</sup> = <i>k</i><sup>15</sup> &nbsp; (c) (−<i>y</i>)<sup>2(4)</sup> = (−<i>y</i>)<sup>8</sup> = <i>y</i><sup>8</sup></div></div><div><div class=\"rv\">2. Tentukan sama ada persamaan (2<sup>3</sup>)<sup>4</sup> = (2<sup>4</sup>)<sup>3</sup> benar atau palsu.</div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">Penyelesaian:</b> <div class=\"rv\">Kiri: (2<sup>3</sup>)<sup>4</sup> = 2<sup>12</sup>. Kanan: (2<sup>4</sup>)<sup>3</sup> = 2<sup>12</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">Maka, (2<sup>3</sup>)<sup>4</sup> = (2<sup>4</sup>)<sup>3</sup> adalah benar.</div></div></div>", "full": ""}, {"sub": "1.2", "n": 5, "N": 17, "kicker": "CONTOH 10", "title": "Hukum indeks dalam operasi pendaraban dan pembahagian", "body": "<p class=\"sl-p\">Permudahkan setiap yang berikut. (a) (5<sup>3</sup> × 7<sup>2</sup>)<sup>4</sup> (b) (2<sup>3</sup> × 3<sup>2</sup> × 11<sup>5</sup>)<sup>2</sup> (c) (<span class=\"fr\"><span>2<i>x</i><sup>3</sup></span><span>3<i>y</i><sup>2</sup></span></span>)<sup>4</sup> (d) <span class=\"fr\"><span>(4<i>m</i><sup>3</sup><i>n</i><sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup></span><span>8<i>m</i><sup>4</sup><i>n</i></span></span></p><div class=\"sl-note\"><b>Imbas kembali:</b> (<i>a</i><sup><i>m</i></sup> × <i>b</i><sup><i>n</i></sup>)<sup><i>p</i></sup> = <i>a</i><sup><i>mp</i></sup> × <i>b</i><sup><i>np</i></sup></div>", "fig": "<div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px 18px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5\"><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">(a)</b> <div class=\"rv\">= 5<sup>3(4)</sup> × 7<sup>2(4)</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">= 5<sup>12</sup> × 7<sup>8</sup></div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">(b)</b> <div class=\"rv\">= 2<sup>3(2)</sup> × 3<sup>2(2)</sup> × 11<sup>5(2)</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">= 2<sup>6</sup> × 3<sup>4</sup> × 11<sup>10</sup></div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">(c)</b> <div class=\"rv\">= <span class=\"fr\"><span>2<sup>4</sup><i>x</i><sup>3(4)</sup></span><span>3<sup>4</sup><i>y</i><sup>2(4)</sup></span></span></div><div class=\"rv\">= <span class=\"fr\"><span>16<i>x</i><sup>12</sup></span><span>81<i>y</i><sup>8</sup></span></span></div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">(d)</b> <div class=\"rv\">= <span class=\"fr\"><span>4<sup>2</sup><i>m</i><sup>3(2)</sup><i>n</i><sup>2(2)</sup></span><span>8<i>m</i><sup>4</sup><i>n</i></span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span>16<i>m</i><sup>6</sup><i>n</i><sup>4</sup></span><span>8<i>m</i><sup>4</sup><i>n</i><sup>1</sup></span></span></div><div class=\"rv\">= 2<i>m</i><sup>6 − 4</sup><i>n</i><sup>4 − 1</sup> = 2<i>m</i><sup>2</sup><i>n</i><sup>3</sup></div></div></div>", "full": ""}, {"sub": "1.2", "n": 6, "N": 17, "kicker": "HUKUM", "title": "Indeks sifar dan indeks negatif", "body": "<div class=\"sl-table\" style=\"width:100%\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#131C2E\"><thead><tr><th style=\"padding:7px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:15px;color:#A78BFA;border:1px solid #22304A;background:#0E1626\">Pembahagian</th><th style=\"padding:7px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:15px;color:#A78BFA;border:1px solid #22304A;background:#0E1626\">Hukum indeks</th><th style=\"padding:7px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:15px;color:#A78BFA;border:1px solid #22304A;background:#0E1626\">Pendaraban berulang</th><th style=\"padding:7px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:15px;color:#A78BFA;border:1px solid #22304A;background:#0E1626\">Kesimpulan</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\">2<sup>3</sup> ÷ 2<sup>3</sup></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\">2<sup>3 − 3</sup> = 2<sup>0</sup></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\"><span class=\"fr\"><span>2 × 2 × 2</span><span>2 × 2 × 2</span></span> = 1</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\">2<sup>0</sup> = 1</td></tr><tr class=\"rv\"><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\">2<sup>3</sup> ÷ 2<sup>5</sup></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\">2<sup>3 − 5</sup> = 2<sup>−2</sup></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\"><span class=\"fr\"><span>2 × 2 × 2</span><span>2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>2<sup>2</sup></span></span></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\">2<sup>−2</sup> = <span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>2<sup>2</sup></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"sl-def\" style=\"--c:#A78BFA\"><p>Suatu nombor atau sebutan algebra yang mempunyai indeks sifar akan memberi nilai 1.</p></div><div style=\"display:inline-block;margin:6px 0;padding:10px 18px;border:2px solid #A78BFA;border-radius:14px;background:#131C2E;font-size:21px;font-weight:700\"><i>a</i><sup>0</sup> = 1 ; <i>a</i> ≠ 0 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <i>a</i><sup>−<i>n</i></sup> = <span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span><i>a</i><sup><i>n</i></sup></span></span> ; <i>a</i> ≠ 0</div><div class=\"sl-note\"><b>Tip:</b> Indeks negatif ialah suatu nombor atau sebutan algebra yang mempunyai indeks negatif. (<span class=\"fr\"><span><i>a</i></span><span><i>b</i></span></span>)<sup>−<i>n</i></sup> = (<span class=\"fr\"><span><i>b</i></span><span><i>a</i></span></span>)<sup><i>n</i></sup></div>", "fig": "", "full": ""}, {"sub": "1.2", "n": 7, "N": 17, "kicker": "CONTOH 11", "title": "Indeks negatif", "body": "<p class=\"sl-p\">1. Nyatakan setiap sebutan berikut dalam bentuk indeks positif. (a) <i>a</i><sup>−3</sup> (b) <i>x</i><sup>−5</sup> (c) <span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>9<sup>−2</sup></span></span> (d) 4<i>m</i><sup>−6</sup> (e) (<span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>7</span></span>)<sup>−4</sup></p><div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5\"><div><div class=\"rv\">(a) <i>a</i><sup>−3</sup> = <span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span><i>a</i><sup>3</sup></span></span></div><div class=\"rv\">(b) <i>x</i><sup>−5</sup> = <span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span><i>x</i><sup>5</sup></span></span></div><div class=\"rv\">(c) <span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>9<sup>−2</sup></span></span> = 9<sup>2</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">(d) 4<i>m</i><sup>−6</sup> = <span class=\"fr\"><span>4</span><span><i>m</i><sup>6</sup></span></span></div><div class=\"rv\">(e) (<span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>7</span></span>)<sup>−4</sup> = (<span class=\"fr\"><span>7</span><span>3</span></span>)<sup>4</sup></div></div></div><p class=\"sl-p\">2. Permudahkan <span class=\"fr\"><span>5<sup>2</sup> × 5<sup>3</sup></span><span>5<sup>8</sup></span></span>.</p>", "fig": "<div style=\"width:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;align-self:flex-start\"><div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5\"><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">Penyelesaian 2:</b> <div class=\"rv\">= 5<sup>2 + 3 − 8</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">= 5<sup>−3</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">= <span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>5<sup>3</sup></span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"sl-note\"><b>Peringatan:</b> 2<i>a</i><sup>−1</sup> ≠ <span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>2<i>a</i></span></span></div></div>", "full": ""}, {"sub": "1.2", "n": 8, "N": 17, "kicker": "HUKUM", "title": "Indeks pecahan", "body": "<p class=\"sl-p\">Di Tingkatan 1, anda telah belajar tentang kuasa dua dan punca kuasa dua serta kuasa tiga dan punca kuasa tiga. Tahukah anda, nilai bagi <i>x</i> dalam <i>x</i><sup>2</sup> = 9 dan <i>x</i><sup>3</sup> = 64 boleh ditentukan dengan indeks yang dikuasakan dengan nilai salingannya?</p><p class=\"sl-p\">Secara generalisasi,</p><div style=\"display:inline-block;margin:6px 0;padding:10px 18px;border:2px solid #A78BFA;border-radius:14px;background:#131C2E;font-size:21px;font-weight:700\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\"><i>n</i></sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\"><i>a</i></span></span> = <i>a</i><sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span><i>n</i></span></span></sup> ; <i>a</i> ≠ 0</div><div style=\"display:inline-block;margin:6px 0;padding:10px 18px;border:2px solid #A78BFA;border-radius:14px;background:#131C2E;font-size:21px;font-weight:700\"><i>a</i><sup><span class=\"fr\"><span><i>m</i></span><span><i>n</i></span></span></sup> = (<i>a</i><sup><i>m</i></sup>)<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span><i>n</i></span></span></sup> = (<i>a</i><sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span><i>n</i></span></span></sup>)<sup><i>m</i></sup> = <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\"><i>n</i></sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\"><i>a</i><sup><i>m</i></sup></span></span> = (<span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\"><i>n</i></sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\"><i>a</i></span></span>)<sup><i>m</i></sup></div>", "fig": "<div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5\"><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">(a)</b> <div class=\"rv\"><i>x</i><sup>2</sup> = 9</div><div class=\"rv\">(<i>x</i><sup>2</sup>)<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span></sup> = 9<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span></sup></div><div class=\"rv\"><i>x</i> = (3<sup>2</sup>)<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span></sup> = 3</div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">(b)</b> <div class=\"rv\"><i>x</i><sup>3</sup> = 64</div><div class=\"rv\">(<i>x</i><sup>3</sup>)<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>3</span></span></sup> = 64<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>3</span></span></sup></div><div class=\"rv\"><i>x</i> = (4<sup>3</sup>)<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>3</span></span></sup> = 4</div></div></div>", "full": ""}, {"sub": "1.2", "n": 9, "N": 17, "kicker": "CONTOH 12", "title": "Menukar antara indeks pecahan dan punca kuasa", "body": "<p class=\"sl-p\">1. Tukarkan setiap sebutan berikut kepada bentuk <i>a</i><sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span><i>n</i></span></span></sup>. (a) <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">2</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\">36</span></span> (b) <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">3</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\">−27</span></span> (c) <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">5</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\"><i>m</i></span></span></p><div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5\"><div><div class=\"rv\">(a) <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">2</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\">36</span></span> = 36<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span></sup> &nbsp; (b) <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">3</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\">−27</span></span> = (−27)<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>3</span></span></sup> &nbsp; (c) <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">5</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\"><i>m</i></span></span> = <i>m</i><sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>5</span></span></sup></div></div></div><p class=\"sl-p\">2. Tukarkan setiap sebutan berikut kepada bentuk <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\"><i>n</i></sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\"><i>a</i></span></span>. (a) 1024<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>5</span></span></sup> (b) 64<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>3</span></span></sup> (c) <i>k</i><sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>7</span></span></sup></p><div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5\"><div><div class=\"rv\">(a) 1024<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>5</span></span></sup> = <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">5</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\">1 024</span></span> &nbsp; (b) 64<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>3</span></span></sup> = <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">3</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\">64</span></span> &nbsp; (c) <i>k</i><sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>7</span></span></sup> = <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">7</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\"><i>k</i></span></span></div></div></div>", "fig": "<div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5\"><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">3. Hitung nilai setiap yang berikut.</b> <div class=\"rv\">(a) <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">5</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\">32</span></span> = (2<sup>5</sup>)<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>5</span></span></sup> = 2<sup>1</sup> = 2</div><div class=\"rv\">(b) <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">3</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\">64</span></span> = (4<sup>3</sup>)<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>3</span></span></sup> = 4</div><div class=\"rv\">(c) 36<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span></sup> = (6<sup>2</sup>)<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span></sup> = 6</div><div class=\"rv\">(d) (−27)<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>3</span></span></sup> = ((−3)<sup>3</sup>)<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>3</span></span></sup> = −3</div></div></div>", "full": ""}, {"sub": "1.2", "n": 10, "N": 17, "kicker": "CONTOH 13", "title": "Indeks pecahan dalam bentuk lain", "body": "<p class=\"sl-p\">1. Tukarkan setiap sebutan berikut kepada bentuk (<i>a</i><sup><i>m</i></sup>)<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span><i>n</i></span></span></sup> dan (<i>a</i><sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span><i>n</i></span></span></sup>)<sup><i>m</i></sup>. (a) 16<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>4</span></span></sup> (b) 125<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>2</span><span>3</span></span></sup></p><div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5\"><div><div class=\"rv\">(a) 16<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>4</span></span></sup> = (16<sup>3</sup>)<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>4</span></span></sup> = (16<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>4</span></span></sup>)<sup>3</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">(b) 125<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>2</span><span>3</span></span></sup> = (125<sup>2</sup>)<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>3</span></span></sup> = (125<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>3</span></span></sup>)<sup>2</sup></div></div></div><p class=\"sl-p\">2. Tukarkan setiap sebutan berikut kepada bentuk <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\"><i>n</i></sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\"><i>a</i><sup><i>m</i></sup></span></span> dan (<span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\"><i>n</i></sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\"><i>a</i></span></span>)<sup><i>m</i></sup>. (a) 16<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>4</span></span></sup> (b) <i>p</i><sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>2</span><span>5</span></span></sup></p><div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5\"><div><div class=\"rv\">(a) 16<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>4</span></span></sup> = <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">4</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\">16<sup>3</sup></span></span> = (<span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">4</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\">16</span></span>)<sup>3</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">(b) <i>p</i><sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>2</span><span>5</span></span></sup> = <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">5</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\"><i>p</i><sup>2</sup></span></span> = (<span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">5</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\"><i>p</i></span></span>)<sup>2</sup></div></div></div>", "fig": "<div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5\"><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">CONTOH 14</b> <div class=\"rv\">Hitung nilai setiap sebutan berikut. (a) 16<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>4</span></span></sup> (b) 125<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>2</span><span>3</span></span></sup></div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">(a)</b> <div class=\"rv\">Kaedah 1: 16<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>4</span></span></sup> = (<span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">4</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\">16</span></span>)<sup>3</sup> = 2<sup>3</sup> = 8</div><div class=\"rv\">Kaedah 2: 16<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>4</span></span></sup> = <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">4</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\">16<sup>3</sup></span></span> = <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">4</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\">4 096</span></span> = 8</div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">(b)</b> <div class=\"rv\">Kaedah 1: 125<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>2</span><span>3</span></span></sup> = (<span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">3</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\">125</span></span>)<sup>2</sup> = 5<sup>2</sup> = 25</div><div class=\"rv\">Kaedah 2: 125<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>2</span><span>3</span></span></sup> = <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">3</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\">125<sup>2</sup></span></span> = <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">3</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\">15 625</span></span> = 25</div></div></div>", "full": ""}, {"sub": "1.2", "n": 11, "N": 17, "kicker": "CONTOH 15", "title": "Operasi yang melibatkan hukum indeks", "body": "<div class=\"sl-table\" style=\"width:100%\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#131C2E\"><thead><tr><th style=\"padding:7px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:15px;color:#A78BFA;border:1px solid #22304A;background:#0E1626\">Hukum indeks</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\"><i>a</i><sup><i>m</i></sup> × <i>a</i><sup><i>n</i></sup> = <i>a</i><sup><i>m</i> + <i>n</i></sup> &nbsp; <i>a</i><sup><i>m</i></sup> ÷ <i>a</i><sup><i>n</i></sup> = <i>a</i><sup><i>m</i> − <i>n</i></sup> &nbsp; (<i>a</i><sup><i>m</i></sup>)<sup><i>n</i></sup> = <i>a</i><sup><i>mn</i></sup></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #22304A;vertical-align:top\"><i>a</i><sup>0</sup> = 1 &nbsp; <i>a</i><sup>−<i>n</i></sup> = <span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span><i>a</i><sup><i>n</i></sup></span></span> &nbsp; <i>a</i><sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span><i>n</i></span></span></sup> = <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\"><i>n</i></sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\"><i>a</i></span></span> &nbsp; <i>a</i><sup><span class=\"fr\"><span><i>m</i></span><span><i>n</i></span></span></sup> = <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\"><i>n</i></sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\"><i>a</i><sup><i>m</i></sup></span></span> = (<span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\"><i>n</i></sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\"><i>a</i></span></span>)<sup><i>m</i></sup></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"sl-p\">Permudahkan setiap yang berikut. (a) <span class=\"fr\"><span>(2<i>x</i><sup>3</sup>)<sup>2</sup> × (3<i>x</i><sup>−1</sup>)</span><span>6<i>x</i><sup>2</sup></span></span> (b) <span class=\"fr\"><span><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">3</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\"><i>m</i><sup>2</sup></span></span> × <i>m</i><sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>3</span></span></sup></span><span><i>m</i><sup>−1</sup></span></span></p>", "fig": "<div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5\"><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">(a)</b> <div class=\"rv\">= <span class=\"fr\"><span>4<i>x</i><sup>6</sup> × 3<i>x</i><sup>−1</sup></span><span>6<i>x</i><sup>2</sup></span></span></div><div class=\"rv\">= <span class=\"fr\"><span>12</span><span>6</span></span> <i>x</i><sup>6 + (−1) − 2</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">= 2<i>x</i><sup>3</sup></div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">(b)</b> <div class=\"rv\">= <span class=\"fr\"><span><i>m</i><sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>2</span><span>3</span></span></sup> × <i>m</i><sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>3</span></span></sup></span><span><i>m</i><sup>−1</sup></span></span></div><div class=\"rv\">= <i>m</i><sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>2</span><span>3</span></span> + <span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>3</span></span> − (−1)</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">= <i>m</i><sup>2</sup></div></div></div>", "full": ""}, {"sub": "1.2", "n": 12, "N": 17, "kicker": "CONTOH 16", "title": "Hitung nilai", "body": "<p class=\"sl-p\">Hitung nilai setiap yang berikut. (a) <span class=\"fr\"><span>81<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>4</span></span></sup> × 25<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>2</span></span></sup></span><span><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><sup style=\"margin-right:-3px\">2</sup>√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\">9</span></span> × 5<sup>2</sup></span></span> (b) <span class=\"fr\"><span>8<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>2</span><span>3</span></span></sup> × 27<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>3</span></span></sup></span><span>2<sup>3</sup> × 9<sup>−<span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span></sup></span></span></p><div class=\"sl-note\"><b>Tip:</b> Tukar setiap asas kepada faktor perdana terlebih dahulu.</div>", "fig": "<div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5\"><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">(a)</b> <div class=\"rv\">= <span class=\"fr\"><span>(3<sup>4</sup>)<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>4</span></span></sup> × (5<sup>2</sup>)<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>2</span></span></sup></span><span>(3<sup>2</sup>)<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span></sup> × 5<sup>2</sup></span></span></div><div class=\"rv\">= <span class=\"fr\"><span>3<sup>1</sup> × 5<sup>3</sup></span><span>3<sup>1</sup> × 5<sup>2</sup></span></span></div><div class=\"rv\">= 3<sup>1 − 1</sup> × 5<sup>3 − 2</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">= 1 × 5 = 5</div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">(b)</b> <div class=\"rv\">= <span class=\"fr\"><span>(2<sup>3</sup>)<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>2</span><span>3</span></span></sup> × (3<sup>3</sup>)<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>3</span></span></sup></span><span>2<sup>3</sup> × (3<sup>2</sup>)<sup>−<span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span></sup></span></span></div><div class=\"rv\">= <span class=\"fr\"><span>2<sup>2</sup> × 3<sup>1</sup></span><span>2<sup>3</sup> × 3<sup>−1</sup></span></span></div><div class=\"rv\">= 2<sup>2 − 3</sup> × 3<sup>1 − (−1)</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">= 2<sup>−1</sup> × 3<sup>2</sup> = <span class=\"fr\"><span>9</span><span>2</span></span> = 4<span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span></div></div></div>", "full": ""}, {"sub": "1.2", "n": 13, "N": 17, "kicker": "CONTOH 17", "title": "Penyelesaian masalah", "body": "<p class=\"sl-p\">Hitung nilai bagi <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\">2</span></span> × 18<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>2</span></span></sup> ÷ 6 tanpa menggunakan kalkulator.</p><div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5\"><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">Memahami masalah</b> <div class=\"rv\">Menghitung nilai bagi nombor dalam bentuk indeks yang diberi dalam asas yang berlainan.</div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">Merancang strategi</b> <div class=\"rv\">Tukar setiap asas kepada faktor perdana dan hitung nilai dengan mengaplikasi hukum indeks.</div></div></div><div class=\"sl-note\"><b>Imbas kembali:</b> Faktor perdana sepunya 6 dan 18 ialah 2 dan 3.</div>", "fig": "<div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5\"><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">Melaksanakan strategi</b> <div class=\"rv\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\">2</span></span> × 18<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>2</span></span></sup> ÷ 6</div><div class=\"rv\">= 2<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span></sup> × (2 × 3 × 3)<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>2</span></span></sup> ÷ (2 × 3)</div><div class=\"rv\">= 2<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span></sup> × 2<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>2</span></span></sup> × 3<sup>3</sup> ÷ (2<sup>1</sup> × 3<sup>1</sup>)</div><div class=\"rv\">= 2<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span> + <span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>2</span></span> − 1</sup> × 3<sup>3 − 1</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">= 2<sup>1</sup> × 3<sup>2</sup> = 18</div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">Membuat kesimpulan</b> <div class=\"rv\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">√<span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding:2px 3px 0;line-height:1.15\">2</span></span> × 18<sup><span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>2</span></span></sup> ÷ 6 = 18</div></div></div>", "full": ""}, {"sub": "1.2", "n": 14, "N": 17, "kicker": "CONTOH 18", "title": "Persamaan indeks", "body": "<p class=\"sl-p\">Hitung nilai <i>x</i> bagi persamaan 2<sup><i>x</i></sup> × 4<sup><i>x</i> + 2</sup> ÷ 2<sup>7</sup> = 1.</p><div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5\"><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">Memahami masalah</b> <div class=\"rv\">Menghitung nilai bagi pemboleh ubah <i>x</i> yang merupakan sebahagian daripada indeks.</div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">Merancang strategi</b> <div class=\"rv\">Soalan ini merupakan satu persamaan. Maka, nilai di kiri persamaan akan sama dengan nilai di kanan persamaan. Tukarkan semua sebutan kepada bentuk indeks dengan asas 2.</div></div></div><div class=\"sl-note\"><b>Peringatan:</b> Jika <i>a</i><sup><i>m</i></sup> = <i>a</i><sup><i>n</i></sup>, maka <i>m</i> = <i>n</i>. Jika <i>a</i><sup><i>m</i></sup> = <i>b</i><sup><i>m</i></sup>, maka <i>a</i> = <i>b</i>.</div>", "fig": "<div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5\"><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">Melaksanakan strategi</b> <div class=\"rv\">2<sup><i>x</i></sup> × 4<sup><i>x</i> + 2</sup> ÷ 2<sup>7</sup> = 1</div><div class=\"rv\">2<sup><i>x</i></sup> × 2<sup>2(<i>x</i> + 2)</sup> ÷ 2<sup>7</sup> = 2<sup>0</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">2<sup><i>x</i> + 2<i>x</i> + 4 − 7</sup> = 2<sup>0</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">3<i>x</i> − 3 = 0</div><div class=\"rv\"><i>x</i> = 1</div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">Membuat kesimpulan</b> <div class=\"rv\">Jika 2<sup><i>x</i></sup> × 4<sup><i>x</i> + 2</sup> ÷ 2<sup>7</sup> = 1, maka, <i>x</i> = 1.</div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">Semak jawapan</b> <div class=\"rv\">Gantikan <i>x</i> = 1: 2<sup>1</sup> × 4<sup>3</sup> ÷ 2<sup>7</sup> = 2<sup>1 + 6 − 7</sup> = 2<sup>0</sup> = 1</div></div></div>", "full": ""}, {"sub": "1.2", "n": 15, "N": 17, "kicker": "CONTOH 19", "title": "Persamaan indeks kuadratik", "body": "<p class=\"sl-p\">Hitung nilai-nilai <i>x</i> yang mungkin bagi persamaan 2<sup><i>x</i><sup>2</sup></sup> × 2<sup><i>x</i></sup> = 2<sup>12</sup>.</p><div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5\"><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">Memahami masalah</b> <div class=\"rv\">Menghitung nilai <i>x</i> yang merupakan sebahagian daripada indeks.</div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">Merancang strategi</b> <div class=\"rv\">Semua asas yang terlibat dalam persamaan adalah sama.</div></div></div><div class=\"sl-note\"><b>Imbas kembali:</b> Selesaikan persamaan kuadratik dengan kaedah pemfaktoran.</div>", "fig": "<div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5\"><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">Melaksanakan strategi</b> <div class=\"rv\">2<sup><i>x</i><sup>2</sup></sup> × 2<sup><i>x</i></sup> = 2<sup>12</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">2<sup><i>x</i><sup>2</sup> + <i>x</i></sup> = 2<sup>12</sup></div><div class=\"rv\"><i>x</i><sup>2</sup> + <i>x</i> = 12</div><div class=\"rv\"><i>x</i><sup>2</sup> + <i>x</i> − 12 = 0</div><div class=\"rv\">(<i>x</i> − 3)(<i>x</i> + 4) = 0</div><div class=\"rv\"><i>x</i> − 3 = 0 atau <i>x</i> + 4 = 0</div><div class=\"rv\"><i>x</i> = 3 atau <i>x</i> = −4</div></div><div><b style=\"color:#A78BFA\">Membuat kesimpulan</b> <div class=\"rv\">Nilai-nilai <i>x</i> yang mungkin bagi persamaan 2<sup><i>x</i><sup>2</sup></sup> × 2<sup><i>x</i></sup> = 2<sup>12</sup> ialah 3 dan −4.</div></div></div>", "full": ""}, {"sub": "1.2", "n": 16, "N": 17, "kicker": "CONTOH 20", "title": "Persamaan serentak", "body": "<p class=\"sl-p\">Selesaikan persamaan serentak berikut. 9<sup><i>m</i></sup> × 3<sup><i>n</i></sup> = 3<sup>10</sup> dan 2<sup><i>m</i></sup> ÷ 2<sup><i>n</i></sup> = 4</p><div class=\"sl-note\"><b>Imbas kembali:</b> Persamaan linear serentak dalam dua pemboleh ubah boleh diselesaikan dengan menggunakan kaedah penggantian atau kaedah penghapusan.</div>", "fig": "<div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5\"><div><div class=\"rv\">9<sup><i>m</i></sup> × 3<sup><i>n</i></sup> = 3<sup>10</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">3<sup>2<i>m</i></sup> × 3<sup><i>n</i></sup> = 3<sup>10</sup></div><div class=\"rv\">2<i>m</i> + <i>n</i> = 10 ........ (1)</div><div class=\"rv\">2<sup><i>m</i></sup> ÷ 2<sup><i>n</i></sup> = 2<sup>2</sup></div><div class=\"rv\"><i>m</i> − <i>n</i> = 2 ........ (2)</div><div class=\"rv\">Persamaan (1) dan (2) boleh diselesaikan melalui kaedah penghapusan.</div><div class=\"rv\">(1) + (2): 3<i>m</i> = 12, <i>m</i> = 4</div><div class=\"rv\">Gantikan <i>m</i> = 4 ke dalam (2): 4 − <i>n</i> = 2, <i>n</i> = 2</div><div class=\"rv\">Maka, <i>m</i> = 4 dan <i>n</i> = 2</div></div></div>", "full": ""}, {"sub": "1.2", "n": 17, "N": 17, "kicker": "CONTOH 21", "title": "Penyelesaian masalah", "body": "<p class=\"sl-p\">Danish dan Ravi menjalankan dua uji kaji untuk menentukan nilai pemboleh ubah <i>x</i> dan <i>y</i>. Persamaan yang diperoleh Danish ialah 8(2<sup><i>x</i></sup>) = 4<sup><i>y</i></sup> sementara Ravi mendapat persamaan 5(25<sup><i>x</i></sup>) = 125<sup><i>y</i></sup> sebagai dapatan uji kaji yang telah dijalankan. Hitung nilai <i>x</i> dan nilai <i>y</i> yang dapat memuaskan kedua-dua uji kaji yang telah dijalankan oleh Danish dan Ravi.</p><div class=\"sl-note\"><b>Tip:</b> Nilai pemboleh ubah <i>x</i> dan <i>y</i> boleh ditentukan jika anda dapat menyelesaikan kedua-dua persamaan tersebut.</div>", "fig": "<div style=\"width:100%;align-self:flex-start;background:#131C2E;border:1px solid #22304A;border-radius:22px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5\"><div><div class=\"rv\">8(2<sup><i>x</i></sup>) = 4<sup><i>y</i></sup>: 2<sup>3</sup>(2<sup><i>x</i></sup>) = 2<sup>2<i>y</i></sup>, maka 3 + <i>x</i> = 2<i>y</i> ........ (1)</div><div class=\"rv\">5(25<sup><i>x</i></sup>) = 125<sup><i>y</i></sup>: 5<sup>1</sup>(5<sup>2<i>x</i></sup>) = 5<sup>3<i>y</i></sup>, maka 1 + 2<i>x</i> = 3<i>y</i> ........ (2)</div><div class=\"rv\">Daripada (1): <i>x</i> = 2<i>y</i> − 3 ........ (3)</div><div class=\"rv\">Gantikan (3) ke dalam (2): 1 + 2(2<i>y</i> − 3) = 3<i>y</i></div><div class=\"rv\">1 + 4<i>y</i> − 6 = 3<i>y</i>, <i>y</i> = 5</div><div class=\"rv\">Gantikan <i>y</i> = 5 ke dalam (3): <i>x</i> = 2(5) − 3 = 7</div><div class=\"rv\">Maka, <i>x</i> = 7, <i>y</i> = 5</div></div></div>", "full": ""}];
